This is the **root cause**. Look at the vendor's sample-rate table carefully. For 48 kHz:

```c
} else if (samp_rate == 48000) {
    aud_hal_set_audio_config_samp_rate_dac(0x3);   // ONLY sets the 2-bit SAMP_RATE field
